{% schema %}
  {
    
    "name": "Section 6",
    "tag": "section",
    "class": "gps-608861457924883030 gps gpsil",
    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/e49d78-3/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_STATIC&editorId=608861457773232726&sectionId=608861457924883030)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"ggoyOEPZBti_text","label":"ggoyOEPZBti_text","default":"<p>4.8/5 from 12,847 verified reviews</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggIoi64seyS_text","label":"ggIoi64seyS_text","default":"<strong>Real Results from </strong><span style=\"color:rgb(189,229,33);\"><i><strong>Real People</strong></i></span>"},{"type":"html","id":"gglxTUStVYH_text","label":"gglxTUStVYH_text","default":"<p><strong>I did the math and now I'm actually mad.&nbsp;</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggw-RwziPRR_text","label":"ggw-RwziPRR_text","default":"<p>Okay so I'm the idiot who spent $847 on PUSH gummies over 14 months. BIOAVAILABILITY OF WHAT?? CORN SYRUP??? Anyway I've been taking FusiForce for 6 weeks and my bench is up 15lbs.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggaD4cutt3o_text","label":"ggaD4cutt3o_text","default":"<p><strong>— Jake R., 34, Austin TX &nbsp;✓&nbsp;</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gggJnhUAYZ2_text","label":"gggJnhUAYZ2_text","default":"<p><strong>Switched from Amazon fakes. I paid $55 for literal candy</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggZcRkCQhBe_text","label":"ggZcRkCQhBe_text","default":"<p>Arrae \"Tone.\" Lemme \"Tone.\" All these brands marketing \"women's creatine\" with skinny models in leotards. I bought them. <strong>They contained basically NOTHING.</strong> Pink label, zero creatine. FusiForce posts their lab reports — I can literally verify what I'm paying for. My glutes finally have REAL fuel.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg9rJ4P4-4H_text","label":"gg9rJ4P4-4H_text","default":"<p><strong>— Jessica M., 31, Portland OR ✓</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggQVC5ocxPn_text","label":"ggQVC5ocxPn_text","default":"<p><strong>My trainer roasted me so hard I switched careers. Jk but almost.</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggePNPLRa8Q_text","label":"ggePNPLRa8Q_text","default":"<p>This man said — I quote — \"bro you've been eating Haribo with extra steps.\" Then he SCREENSHOT it and sent it to our GROUP CHAT</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggXzpiVNPIv_text","label":"ggXzpiVNPIv_text","default":"<p><strong>— Derek M., 29, Chicago IL ✓</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg9hwJcfBYh_text","label":"gg9hwJcfBYh_text","default":"<p><strong>I'm 5'2\" and was terrified of 'bulking up'</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggN_e_AXI-s_text","label":"ggN_e_AXI-s_text","default":"<p>Avoided creatine for YEARS because influencers made it sound like one gummy = instant She-Hulk. Spoiler: that's not how anything works. Three months on FusiForce: same 5'2\". Not bulky. But I can carry ALL my groceries in one trip now. <strong>Like a CHAMPION.</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggFrl5V6ceD_text","label":"ggFrl5V6ceD_text","default":"<p><strong>— Emma L., 29, Seattle WA ✓</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gglO68ZJIaF_text","label":"gglO68ZJIaF_text","default":"<p><strong>14 months of expensive candy</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggqcjVgubVw_text","label":"ggqcjVgubVw_text","default":"<p>I trusted influencers. Bought what they promoted. Defended it to my gym friends. \"You don't understand bioavailability!\" Then the testing came out. <strong>ZERO creatine.</strong> I wasn't a non-responder. I was a scam victim. FusiForce shows their lab reports. My deadlift is up 25lbs. My trust in influencers is gone forever.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg5QkazlOiw_text","label":"gg5QkazlOiw_text","default":"<p><strong>— Brittany N., 26, San Diego CA ✓</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggiRvQasRqV_text","label":"ggiRvQasRqV_text","default":"<p><strong>I have beef with Gary and FusiForce is my weapon</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggiK0q1sbiJ_text","label":"ggiK0q1sbiJ_text","default":"<p>Gary does curls in the squat rack. I looked him dead in his eyes and said \"nothing really, just genetics I guess.\" GARY LOOKED SO DEFEATED.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggFB0yUp4_c_text","label":"ggFB0yUp4_c_text","default":"<p><strong>—</strong> Chris P., 33, Boston MA <strong>✓</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggguEv5Ez_W_text","label":"ggguEv5Ez_W_text","default":"<p><strong>I accidentally started a cult at my office</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggxcnf1i7by_text","label":"ggxcnf1i7by_text","default":"<p>KAREN DOESN'T EVEN WORK OUT. It's been 6 weeks. I have converted 11 coworkers to FusiForce. We have a Slack channel called #gummygang. IT flagged it.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggQx8ePcYoy_text","label":"ggQx8ePcYoy_text","default":"<p><strong>— Tyler B., 28, San Francisco CA ✓</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggvdHCyW0cd_text","label":"ggvdHCyW0cd_text","default":"<p><strong>I converted my entire book club</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggjlk9QnnFo_text","label":"ggjlk9QnnFo_text","default":"<p>We were supposed to discuss \"Lessons in Chemistry.\" Instead I gave a PowerPoint on creatine. Six weeks later, 7 members take FusiForce. We have a group chat called \"Creatine Queens.\" <strong>Karen hit 135lbs on squat. KAREN IS 54. WE CRIED.</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggwFQUN465x_text","label":"ggwFQUN465x_text","default":"<p><strong>— Michelle T., 42, Denver CO ✓</strong></p>"}],
